      "type": "text",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 396,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 40,
      "strokeColor": "#55534d",
      "text": "Real Kraków weather + air quality. A model trained on clean summer air decays as the\nwinter heating season fills the basin with smog — and the loop retrains to keep up.",
